{"id":"n79539-1-7","stage":4,"title":"추수 · 秋收","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79539-1-7-1","ko":"할아버지께서는 겨울을 어떻게 보내실 계획이세요?","zh":"爷爷，您打算怎么度过这个冬天呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지께서는","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지께서는","audio":"/audio/0d517ae379cfaa18c6c4.mp3"}},{"text":"겨울을","meaning":"冬天，冬季","explanation":"겨울：冬天，冬季；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겨울을","audio":"/audio/a9bfa163016af094f0d9.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"보내실","meaning":"度过","explanation":"보내다：度过；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"7","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내실","audio":"/audio/9457819813934485a99b.mp3"}},{"text":"계획이세요?","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획이세요","audio":"/audio/0b20910c1b281ac477c9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"让时间流逝。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]}],"audio":"/audio/efc0016a00bbe8d3b2bd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79539-1-7-2","ko":"가을에 추수를 하느라 힘들었으니 좀 쉬어야지.","zh":"秋天收庄稼太辛苦了，得好好休息一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가을에","meaning":"秋天，秋季","explanation":"가을：秋天，秋季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가을","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가을에","audio":"/audio/c3cc0efde43aee2ad850.mp3"}},{"text":"추수를","meaning":"秋收","explanation":"추수：秋收；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"추수","audio":"/audio/b57e4306c554e79475fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79539","senseId":"1","lemma":"추수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추수를","audio":"/audio/1d8f0671b979c8c06af8.mp3"}},{"text":"하느라","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；느라：说明因忙于前一动作而出现后续情况，常接不利结果。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하느라","audio":"/audio/f5fce7735e6d3a73addd.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들었으니","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들었으니","audio":"/audio/0361bb3f96e8447bc927.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬어야지.","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬어야지","audio":"/audio/d0c7f875b3eeffcbdde4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c5911194be78d7d5","term":"가을","zh":"秋天，秋季","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3","entryId":"32204","definition":"四季中的一个，介于夏天和冬天之间的季节。","pronunciation":["가을"]},{"id":"b57e4306c554e794","term":"추수","zh":"秋收","audio":"/audio/b57e4306c554e79475fc.mp3","entryId":"79539","definition":"秋天收割水田和旱地里成熟的谷物或农作物等。","pronunciation":["추수"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7e822475c4e91e84de24.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.715,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79539","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":132,"sequenceScore":2.5417,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["秋天收庄稼太辛苦了，得好好休息一下。","爷爷，您打算怎么度过这个冬天呢？","好久没运动了，感觉真好。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爷爷，您打算怎么度过这个冬天呢？","好久没运动了，感觉真好。","秋天收庄稼太辛苦了，得好好休息一下。"],"answer":2}]}
